00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
Your gamble is readable 0.5 s before the choice is made

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:09,000
Six patients, already implanted for surgical monitoring

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,500
A video game: hallways, bombs and treasure chests

4
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:18,000
Two patches in the orbitofrontal cortex, about 2 cm apart

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,500
One fires before take the risk, the other before avoid

6
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:27,000
Together they predicted the choice about 0.5 s before it was made

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Six patients, one video game. Not a free-will claim

8
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Starkweather, Chang, Knight. UCSF and UC Berkeley
